 <div class="career-next"><div><p class="label">WHY THIS ROLE IS A COHERENT NEXT STEP</p><h3>Bring that experience closer to model safety.</h3><p>Handshake’s Safety SPA role brings together the work I want to build on: interpreting policy, designing review workflows, investigating inconsistent judgments and coordinating delivery. My enterprise governance work gives me a foundation in ownership and controls; my analytical and research work gives me a foundation in classification and evaluation.</p><p>I would bring those strengths to the operational work behind reliable human evaluation: clearer rubrics, usable reviewer guidance, evidence-based escalation and quality reporting that supports action. I would build deeper expertise in safety policy and annotation through the team’s training and supervised practice.</p></div><aside><p class="label">HOW I WOULD EXPLAIN MY PATH</p><blockquote>“I started by learning how people describe their needs and how teams turn those needs into products. I then built the analytical skills to turn large, messy datasets into evidence. In enterprise AI, I applied that combination to adoption, approval workflows and governance. My research work added a closer look at model behavior and evaluation. Now I want to bring those pieces together in AI safety operations—helping teams make consistent judgments and turn policy into reliable execution.”</blockquote></aside></div>
 <p class="small">The chapters show connected capabilities; several roles and projects overlapped in time.</p>
